WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.720
Are you ready for your repentance?!

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.100
Go! Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.340
Photon Stream of Destruction!

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.050
Faker...!

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:36.970
Your attacks won't make it past a genius mind like mine!

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:42.060
Behold! This is Heart eartH's true form!

00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:46.670
Number 92! Heart eartH Dragon!

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.040
Why on earth is there a new Number on his field!?

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.680
I'll explain it to you fools!

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:00.470
When Heart-eartH has no Overlay Units while being attacked,

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.790
by using Heart-eartH as an Overlay Unit,

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.380
I can Special Summon Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.590
And when this Monster has been Special Summoned successfully,

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.080
all opposing Attack Position Monsters
are changed into Defense Position!

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.190
Well, you were fools to try to fight back against a genius!

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.730
Bow down before Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:32.850
So our Monsters were changed to Defense Mode before the damage could reach.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:35.320
So that's why the attack stopped!

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.870
It still had an effect like this?

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:40.390
Here I go. Trap, activate!

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:42.570
Fake Form!

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:47.020
When your Monsters have been changed into Defense Mode,

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:51.620
this card deals you 400 damage for each Monster!

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:52.340
What?!

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.280
Guys!

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:56.950
Yuma...

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:59.150
It's over now!

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.670
You take 1200 damage!

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:05.780
Oh crap!

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:09.350
I activate Kuriphoton's effect!

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.230
By sending this card from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.480
and paying half of my Life...

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.090
...the Effect Damage is negated!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:28.870
Kaito!?

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.450
Hey, is your body...?!

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:32.340
Calm down!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:36.160
I can't afford to break down yet...

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:40.330
Not until I have defeated you, Dr. Faker!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.330
You fool!

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:46.220
Had you been defeated, you would not have had to suffer on!

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:49.070
My turn! Draw!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.130
"I will defeat you?" Didn't you hear me?

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:56.240
Your defeat is coming closer step by step,

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:59.090
heralding the extinction of the Astral World!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:03.130
Heart-eartH Dragon, attack Shark Drake!

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:04.320
What'd you say?

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.670
He's attacking with Zero Attack Points?!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:12.110
Not only is Heart-eartH Dragon not destroyed in battle,

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:15.290
but I Battle Damage against me is negated,

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:19.160
while you guys receive the original damage in my stead!

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:20.250
What?!

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:21.830
I see...

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:27.480
By using a Zero Attack Power Monster to attack the 2100 Defense Power Shark Drake,

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.500
the result is 2100 from the original damage.

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:34.740
It's all negated on his end and bounced back to us!

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:36.490
Our Life is a mere 600.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.200
If we get hit by 2100 damage...!

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.630
Go! Heart Break Cannon!

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.270
N-No way...!

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:53.900
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:59.240
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:16.090
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:21.890
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:26.480
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.520
<i>It's too soon for us to turn back now</i>

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:37.610
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:43.160
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:48.960
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:54.000
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:59.470
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:05.140
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:11.310
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:17.400
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.340
I won't let you! Trap, activate!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.630
Escape Lure!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.680
This card changes the attack target to a different Monster,

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:28.930
"Numbers 70: The Terrifying, Most Sinister Dragon Appears!
 The False Skeletal God Dragon, Heart-eartH Dragon!"

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.220
and halves the resulting Battle Damage!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.730
I change the attack target to Hope!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.570
Fool! There's no sense in doing that!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.240
Why is he choosing Hope as the attack target?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.150
Yuma, think...

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.870
If we reduce that guy's damage, our damage will be reduced!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.000
I see!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.080
Trap, activate! Half Unbreak!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.540
This card halves the Battle Damage!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.630
I will use this effect...

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.170
on Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.390
You used the Trap to protect my Monster?

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.140
That's right! By reducing the damage you would receive,

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.270
the damage sent back to us is reduced as well!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.070
That way the damage for Heart-eartH Dragon is 500!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:27.280
That means we only take 500 damage!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.300
Tch... Useless struggle...

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:56.390
But now I will activate another effect of Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:01.150
Not only is the Battle Damage inflicted on me negated,

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.020
but I gain that amount of Life instead!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.530
I set one card and end my turn!

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.200
Guys... Good luck!

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.290
All hope is.... resting on you three.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:21.420
Yuma, Ryouga. You braved this well.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.380
You're still patronizing even now?

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.050
Damn... Our Life is down to 100 now.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.260
If this goes on...

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:33.640
What's wrong, Yuma?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.600
If you're going to whine, lie down there and go to sleep!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.440
Hey... I-I'm not whining at all!

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:42.770
Like heck will I give up!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.860
Astral is waiting for me to save him!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:51.110
I will definitely... rescue you!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.450
I'll bring it to 'em!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.450
My turn! Draw!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.410
Look, Astral!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.460
Go, Hope!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.380
Aspiring Emperor - Hope will be the Xyz Material!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.590
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.840
The messenger who changes chaos into light!

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.390
Come forth, Chaos Number 39!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.440
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:32.360
Chaos Numbers. The new power of the Numbers.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.950
But something like that won't beat my Heart-eartH Dragon!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:41.040
<i>Sure, Heart-eartH Dragon can negate attacks,</i>

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.040
<i>and bounce back the damage to us.</i>

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.960
<i>But... I'm sure there's something in my hand.</i>

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.090
<i>Think... think hard...</i>

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:52.380
That's it!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.340
Go, Hope Ray!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.930
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:03.730
Did you finally make up your mind
to throw your life down the drain?

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.270
Don't joke around!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.940
I haven't given up at all!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:11.190
From my hand, I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Gamusharush!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:17.570
With Gamusharush, I can set the Attack Power of my battling Monster to zero,

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:21.740
and the opposing player will receive 600 points of damage.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.800
I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.630
I see. You actually put a bit of thought into that one.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.930
If attacks won't work, you just reduce his Life with effects.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.640
You're being way too reckless for a mere 600 points of damage.

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:47.350
With the power of our bonds, we <i>will</i> beat this guy!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.020
I'm counting on you, Shark!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.070
My turn! Draw!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:56.860
<i>Just a bit longer...</i>

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:01.030
At this moment, the effect of Heart-eartH Dragon activates!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.950
After this monster was special summoned,

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.460
all cards then Summoned or set on the opponent's field...

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.880
...will be Banished on the next turn!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:10.920
What did you say?!

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.760
My Hope Ray is...!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.680
Bonds, you say? Such stupidity.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.680
Things like that are merely an illusion!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.400
If it really exists, show it to me!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.820
The thing you call the "power of your bonds".

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.150
It's true that you can't actually <i>see</i> the bonds you share with someone.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:41.450
They're something deep down within your heart that connects with another's!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.950
As long as they exist, our feelings always will reach one another!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.370
Shark...

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:51.630
With Marine Biting Shark Drake, I will...

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:53.710
...Chaos Xyz Change!

00:10:56.630 --> 00:11:02.050
With Shark Drake as Xyz Material, I Special Summon a Chaos Number!

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.510
Come forth, Chaos Number 32!

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:11.980
Biting Marine Serpent Shark Drake Weiss!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.150
<i>I won't give up either. I'll it to show him.</i>

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.110
<i>My own way to 'Bring it to 'em!</i>

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.240
I activate the Magic Card, Deep Sea Attack!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:29.460
With this card, I send a Water-Attribute Monster with 2000 or more Attack Points from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:34.710
and on this turn, one Monster on my field can attack the opponent directly!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.920
I send Jawsman to the Graveyard!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:43.260
With this, Shark Drake Weiss can attack directly!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:48.220
Shark Drake Weiss, direct attack on Dr. Faker!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.730
Depth Chaos Bite!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:55.400
He avoided Heart-eartH Dragon by attacking Faker!

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:01.990
You did it, Shark!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.070
You fool!

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.910
Trap, activate!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.740
Fake Life!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:14.330
This card can negate the damage from a direct attack,

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.590
and then let me recover that amount of Life Points instead!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:20.550
That darn Faker increased his Life Points again!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.010
I set one card and my tu-...

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.180
...end my turn.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.470
Shark!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.100
Ryouga,

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:35.480
Because of Byron's scheme, you lost your pride and your younger sister...

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.730
...and now you're going to lose <i>yourself</i> in the most pathetic way?

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:44.410
Shark! Hey, what happened?!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.620
You're injured?!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:50.910
It's no big deal!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:51.750
But...!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:52.620
Ryouga.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:13:00.380
Your feelings... I've received all of them!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.380
Let's go! My turn! Draw!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.050
You still don't seem to understand!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:09.220
Heart-eartH Dragon's effect activates!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.730
Your cards will be Banished!

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:17.770
Disappear, Shark Drake Weiss!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.320
Now try to prove it to me!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.740
What those bonds of yours are all about!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.080
Huh?

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.920
I've been waiting for this moment, Dr. Faker!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.210
<i>You're</i> the one who fell for it!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.840
What did you say?

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.970
Trap, activate! Xyz-Dimension Splash!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.350
When this card gets Banished by my opponent,

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:59.730
I can Special Summon two Level Eight Water-Attribute Monsters from my deck.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.440
A Trap that activates when it's Banished?!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:07.150
I Special Summon two Ancient Shark Hyper Megalodons!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:12.030
The effects of the Monsters Summoned by this effect are negated,

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.620
and they can neither attack nor be released!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.500
So you took advantage of Heart-eartH Dragon's effect?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.750
I <i>did</i> say our feelings would definitely reach you!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:22.880
Kaito...

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.130
I'm entrusting you... with this...

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:27.590
The last of my...

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:29.800
Hope!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:32.510
Shark!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:33.930
Ryouga...

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:46.030
I Overlay the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes and the two Hyper Megalodons!

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.200
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.950
Xyz Summon!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.580
Great Galaxy of Reversal!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:02.920
Become the rolling waves of light and show your mighty form!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.800
Descend, my very soul!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:14.510
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.740
I'm counting on you, Kaito.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:33.870
Damn...

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.410
I can't break down yet...

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.170
Yuma, Ryouga...

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.920
This is <i>my</i> power!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.800
Neo Galaxy-Eyes' effect activates!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.840
When this Monster has been Summoned successfully,

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.010
the effects of all other Monsters on the field are negated!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.020
Photon Howling!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.480
What?!

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.690
With this, the effects of Heart-eartH Dragon are negated!

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.610
Then, by detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:12.450
all Overlay Units from all other Monsters on the field will be absorbed!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.780
Then, for this turn, its Attack Power will

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:20.870
increase by 500 points for each Overlay Unit absorbed!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:25.250
5000 Attack Points?! Impossible!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:29.630
Dr. Faker, I will redeem you with my own hands!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.470
Are you ready for your repentance?!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:36.180
You fool! You're just a clueless brat!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.760
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.890
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:05.460
You did it! Faker just got some big damage!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.840
Give up, Dr. Faker. It's over.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.630
Release Haruto <i>now</i>!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.060
Kaito...

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:25.310
Do you... have any idea what you're doing?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.060
What did you say?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:33.530
The only way for Haruto to survive is to destroy the Astral World!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.580
Wha... What do you mean by that?

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:49.250
Without the power of Barian, there is no way now Haruto can survive.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.460
What did you say?

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:54.210
Haruto was a frail child ever since he was born.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.760
Even now, his flame of life

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.100
is so small, it might vanish in an instant.

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:05.270
That's why, in order to save his life...

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.770
...I just had to visit the Parallel Worlds.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.770
For that reason, Dad and Tron were...

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:17.740
When I decided to save Haruto, I gave up everything.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:20.490
My friends and partners...

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.910
Byron and Kazuma.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:28.000
I had to sacrifice them to be able to open the door.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.210
Waiting on the other side of the door was...

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:33.380
Barian.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:40.140
Substance does not exist within their world.
 It is a world made up of some kind of energy.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:44.350
They show no ability of metaphysics in their world.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:47.640
I made a deal with them.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.310
To give Haruto the power he needs to survive,

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.230
I have to destroy the Astral World!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.650
So I started collecting the Numbers,

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:02.120
to use their power in the Sphere Field Cannon,

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.540
that I had planned to destroy the Astral World with.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.790
If I don't keep my promise,

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:14.500
sooner or later these guys will come to take Haruto away.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.420
Haruto...

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:25.310
If that's really the truth, then why...

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.520
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.890
I couldn't say it...

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:32.350
If I would have told you,

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.570
you would have tried to burden the bitter fate all on your shoulders.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:39.950
I was grateful, Kaito...

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.950
Without complaining,

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:47.160
you fought for Haruto as Number Hunter.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.790
That's why I didn't want to make you suffer any more than you already have.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.460
That's why...

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.250
That's wrong.

00:19:57.880 --> 00:19:59.630
Why didn't you believe in your family?

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.260
Why did you believe in them and not trust in me?!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:05.300
Dad!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:08.810
Kaito...

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.980
If they come to take away Haruto's life,

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:16.820
I will protect Haruto!
I will protect him to the very end!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:18.820
Even if it costs my life!

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:23.700
Kaito...

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:28.120
Kaito, I will lend you my power!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:32.040
I don't know anything about these Barian guys, but I will beat them to bits!

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:33.000
Me too.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:34.670
Shark!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.330
Don't get me wrong.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:38.170
There's something I need to settle with them.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.510
I'll crush them for sure!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:45.050
With the three of us joining forces, Barian won't stand a chance!

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.430
I'll do my best!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.510
Dad!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:51.770
You don't need to give up anything anymore!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.100
Just believe in us.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.480
We'll settle this with them once and for all!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.230
Kaito...

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.150
Dr. Faker.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:08.120
Dr. Faker... how regrettable.

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:11.540
Father?!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.790
Don't come...!

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.160
Don't come here!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.370
Stop it!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.580
What's wrong, Dad!?

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:21.840
I thought you could do better than this...

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.600
The Number is...?!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:48.410
Yuma Tsukumo. Kaito Tenjo. Ryouga Kamishiro.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.280
The Duel hasn't been settled yet.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:53.950
Who are you!?

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.000
I <i>am</i>... Barian.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:21:59.630
You are Barian?!

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:15.680
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:21.310
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:31.990
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:36.290
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.540
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:40.250
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:42.920
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:48.090
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.430
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:59.060
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:05.570
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:11.030
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:21.920
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:27.130
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:32.680
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.440
Barian has finally appeared in front of us!

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:46.780
We ran out of answers, being cornered by his overwhelming power!

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.820
Our hope and our future...

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:51.360
How could we give them up like this?!

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:53.450
Haruto, don't tell me you...

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.160
Astral, I'll come to you!

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:58.330
Our power, we will raise it to the ultimate!

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.910
Give me power, ZEXAL Weapon!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:03.170
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:06.420
"The Miraculous 'Bring it to 'Em'!
Open a Path to the Future, ZEXAL!

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:09.260
Take the feelings everyone has entrusted to us!

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:13.590
Hope Ray, Shark Drake Weiss, and Neo Galaxy.

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:15.350
What's the sum of their Numbers?

00:24:15.350 --> 00:24:19.810
Hope Ray's is 39, Shark Drake's is 32 and Neo Galaxy-Eyes is... umm....

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:23.270
The answer is 71, because Neo Galaxy isn't a Number.

00:24:23.270 --> 00:24:24.650
You tricked me...!
